{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01147",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.2,
      "end_seconds": 4.32,
      "duration_seconds": 3.12,
      "text": "Sorry, doctor, shall I sit here?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.8,
      "end_seconds": 10.58,
      "duration_seconds": 4.78,
      "text": "Yes, come in and sit down. What brings you here today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.58,
      "end_seconds": 17.85,
      "duration_seconds": 6.27,
      "text": "I've been getting breathless lying flat, and I wanted to get it checked."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 18.81,
      "end_seconds": 22.01,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "Can you tell me when it first started?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 23.66,
      "end_seconds": 27.09,
      "duration_seconds": 3.43,
      "text": "Since this morning, that's when it began."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 27.83,
      "end_seconds": 41.2,
      "duration_seconds": 13.37,
      "text": "Can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps. It helps to be thorough at this stage."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 41.89,
      "end_seconds": 50.42,
      "duration_seconds": 8.53,
      "text": "I mean, it settles a little with extra pillows. Lying flat definitely sets it off. Mild, really."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 52.03,
      "end_seconds": 54.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.67,
      "text": "Does anything else come with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 56.15,
      "end_seconds": 76.14,
      "duration_seconds": 19.99,
      "text": "Right, when it starts I tend to get swollen ankles as well. The swollen ankles? That's been for about two weeks. As for swollen ankles, it's all the time. I notice it more with evening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 78.24,
      "end_seconds": 79.95,
      "duration_seconds": 1.71,
      "text": "Have you had tiredness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 81.98,
      "end_seconds": 83.2,
      "duration_seconds": 1.22,
      "text": "Mm, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 90.4,
      "end_seconds": 94.34,
      "duration_seconds": 3.94,
      "text": "Let's talk a little about your daily life and habits."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 96.21,
      "end_seconds": 114.88,
      "duration_seconds": 18.67,
      "text": "I quit smoking around ten years ago. I used to drink heavily but I stopped four years ago. My husband and I live above the shop. I work in accounts at a hospital. Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 116.82,
      "end_seconds": 120.78,
      "duration_seconds": 3.96,
      "text": "Anything in your past medical history I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 121.94,
      "end_seconds": 124.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.15,
      "text": "I have heart failure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 124.99,
      "end_seconds": 125.69,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 130.97,
      "end_seconds": 148.22,
      "duration_seconds": 17.25,
      "text": "High blood pressure, for about a year. I'd rather not end up on lots of tablets if I can avoid it. I wasn't sure whether to come in at all, to be honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 150.05,
      "end_seconds": 151.87,
      "duration_seconds": 1.82,
      "text": "Is there anything more?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 152.48,
      "end_seconds": 163.61,
      "duration_seconds": 11.13,
      "text": "Right, so heart failure and high blood pressure are already on your record. We'll keep that in mind today. So, anything surgical in your history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 164.3,
      "end_seconds": 168.03,
      "duration_seconds": 3.73,
      "text": "Just my tonsils removed, as a teenager."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 185.57,
      "end_seconds": 187.63,
      "duration_seconds": 2.06,
      "text": "Let's run through your medicines."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 188.41,
      "end_seconds": 195.47,
      "duration_seconds": 7.06,
      "text": "I take something called furo... furosemide, 40 milligrams, maybe, every morning for the fluid."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 196.61,
      "end_seconds": 200.58,
      "duration_seconds": 3.97,
      "text": "Have you got the box or the prescription on you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 202.08,
      "end_seconds": 209.93,
      "duration_seconds": 7.85,
      "text": "Not with me. I'll bring it next time. Okay, so I take ramipril, every morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 211.86,
      "end_seconds": 214.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "How much do you take?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 215.19,
      "end_seconds": 216.54,
      "duration_seconds": 1.35,
      "text": "It's 5 milligrams."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 217.74,
      "end_seconds": 219.49,
      "duration_seconds": 1.75,
      "text": "Any sign of palpitations?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 220.09,
      "end_seconds": 222.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "Not that I've noticed, no palpitations."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 223.56,
      "end_seconds": 226.74,
      "duration_seconds": 3.18,
      "text": "Sure. Did you get fainting or chest pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 228.51,
      "end_seconds": 232.85,
      "duration_seconds": 4.34,
      "text": "I haven't had fainting or chest pain, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 233.42,
      "end_seconds": 237.39,
      "duration_seconds": 3.97,
      "text": "What about your tummy and bowels, anything unusual there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 238.4,
      "end_seconds": 240.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "No, that side's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 244.85,
      "end_seconds": 247.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "How are your joints, any aches elsewhere?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 248.67,
      "end_seconds": 251.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "No, joints are fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 251.67,
      "end_seconds": 254.72,
      "duration_seconds": 3.05,
      "text": "I'll note down your vital signs first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 266.2,
      "end_seconds": 268.66,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "That's it, just a little longer..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 290.59,
      "end_seconds": 296.17,
      "duration_seconds": 5.58,
      "text": "Okay: pressure 118 over 75, temperature 37.0, respiratory rate 25, pulse 87."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 297.8,
      "end_seconds": 299.74,
      "duration_seconds": 1.94,
      "text": "Shall I start the examination?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 313.92,
      "end_seconds": 315.43,
      "duration_seconds": 1.51,
      "text": "Yeah, no problem."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 316.86,
      "end_seconds": 318.14,
      "duration_seconds": 1.28,
      "text": "Look straight ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 336.63,
      "end_seconds": 343.46,
      "duration_seconds": 6.83,
      "text": "There is pitting swelling of both ankles and a few crackles at the lung bases."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 345.47,
      "end_seconds": 356.22,
      "duration_seconds": 10.75,
      "text": "You can sit up now. So where does that leave us? It points towards heart failure with some fluid on board. A kidney problem is still possible."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 357.13,
      "end_seconds": 363.53,
      "duration_seconds": 6.4,
      "text": "Sorry, what was I saying, I'm scared it's something bad. Is it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 368.93,
      "end_seconds": 401.69,
      "duration_seconds": 32.76,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like heart failure with some fluid on board, but I'd like to confirm. I'll request an echocardiogram, it'll help with heart failure. I'll request blood tests, it'll help with heart failure. I'd rather check than guess, and this is the quickest way to know more. Weigh yourself every morning and tell us if you gain two kilos in three days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 402.09,
      "end_seconds": 419.27,
      "duration_seconds": 17.18,
      "text": "Mm-hmm. The heart failure nurse would be the right next step, I'll refer you. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 421.2,
      "end_seconds": 424.62,
      "duration_seconds": 3.42,
      "text": "Right, I know what to watch for."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 426.41,
      "end_seconds": 434.11,
      "duration_seconds": 7.7,
      "text": "Do get help quickly if the symptoms get worse. That's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 436.18,
      "end_seconds": 439.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "Thank you, uh, that's helpful."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 439.69,
      "end_seconds": 440.95,
      "duration_seconds": 1.26,
      "text": "Take care now."
    }
  ]
}